Z||000000||BigBoyToys||01-21-2000||08:27 PM||||Are motorheads likely to also have critters (and not just the two legged Monkeygirl kind)? Just out of curiosity, since we've identified member's Fiero's, locations, other motor toys etc... I just thought; well are some of you critter people like myself? If so let us know! For my extended family consist of:<BR>Australian Sheperd (Kiefer, Tri-colored)<BR>Calico Kitty (MoUs-PoUs-WoUs-DoUs-SoUs-LoUs)<BR>2 Yellow Legged Tortises (Fred and Ethel)<BR>1 Ball Python <BR>1 Albino King Snake<BR>1 Rose Tarantula (yeh rite what wife)<BR>And what ever else lurks in the dark!  ||||reg||5
